	// ── Window resize ──
	// `on_resize` (Container.take_resize) fires on the frame whose content
	// rect changed; the new size rides the dispatch window via these
	// getters. The framework has ALREADY re-laid-out the registered roots
	// (the delegate + the relayout pass) — handlers re-layout app-owned
	// panes (tab pages, split panes). FrameEvents.resized / width / height
	// carry the same record for `frame`.

